      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Aberration correction transformed electron microscopy into a tool capable of resolving atomic structure and chemistry with extraordinary precision, enabling advances across materials science.",
        "attribution": "The proposed names cover key theoretical, instrument-building, and practical implementation contributions to corrected electron optics.",
        "maturity": "The technology is established in widely used instruments, and its impact on atomic-scale materials characterization is well demonstrated.",
